{"seq":3,"slug":"ethics","title":"伦理学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics","introMarkdown":"# 伦理学 简介\n\n伦理学系统地探究\"什么是对的行为\"和\"什么是好的生活\"，它不满足于给出现成答案，而是邀请学习者在相互竞争的道德理论之间进行严肃的理性审视。在技术快速演进、全球化深度交织的今天，伦理反思已经从哲学课堂延伸到医院、公司董事会和人工智能实验室。\n\n本知识体系沿着\"理论根基—现实场景—元层面追问—当代挑战\"的线索展开，引导自学者逐步建立自己的道德推理框架。\n\n第一章**伦理学理论**介绍三大经典进路：亚里士多德传统的美德伦理学关注品格的塑造，康德式义务论强调行为本身的道德法则，后果主义则以结果的善恶衡量行为的对错。理解它们各自的解释力与局限，是展开一切伦理讨论的前提。\n\n第二章**应用伦理学**将理论工具带入具体领域：生命医学中的知情同意与基因编辑争议，商业世界里的企业社会责任与利益冲突，以及面对生态危机时人类对自然的义务。每个议题都要求学习者在多重价值之间做出有据的权衡。\n\n第三章**元伦理学**退后一步，追问道德判断本身的性质——道德事实是否客观存在？道德标准是否因文化而异？道德心理机制如何影响我们的伦理直觉？这些问题虽然抽象，却决定了伦理讨论的深度和严谨程度。\n\n第四章**当代伦理问题**聚焦技术伦理、全球正义与动物权利等前沿议题，展示伦理学如何回应正在发生的社会变革，并为政策制定和个人选择提供思考坐标。\n\n建议自学者先扎实掌握第一章的理论框架，再进入应用与元伦理的双向探索，这样既能在具体案例中磨练判断力，又能在更深层面反思道德思维的基础。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ethical-theories","title":"伦理学理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/ethical-theories","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"virtue-ethics","title":"美德伦理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/ethical-theories/virtue-ethics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deontological-ethics","title":"义务论伦理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/ethical-theories/deontological-ethics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"consequentialism","title":"后果主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/ethical-theories/consequentialism"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"applied-ethics","title":"应用伦理学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/applied-ethics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bioethics","title":"生命伦理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/applied-ethics/bioethics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"business-ethics","title":"商业伦理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/applied-ethics/business-ethics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"environmental-ethics","title":"环境伦理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/applied-ethics/environmental-ethics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"metaethics","title":"元伦理学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/metaethics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"moral-realism","title":"道德实在论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/metaethics/moral-realism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"moral-relativism","title":"道德相对主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/metaethics/moral-relativism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"moral-psychology","title":"道德心理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/metaethics/moral-psychology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"contemporary-ethics","title":"当代伦理问题","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/contemporary-ethics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"technology-ethics","title":"技术伦理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/contemporary-ethics/technology-ethics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"global-justice","title":"全球正义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/contemporary-ethics/global-justice"},{"seq":3,"slug":"animal-rights","title":"动物权利","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/ethics/contemporary-ethics/animal-rights"}]}]}